    "textContent":  "function getThingSpeakData() {\n  // Replace with your ThingSpeak channel ID and API key\n  var channelID = \"YOUR_THINGSPEAK_CHANNEL_ID\";\n  var apiKey = \"YOUR_THINGSPEAK_API_KEY\";\n  var url = \"https://api.thingspeak.com/channels/\" + channelID + \"/feeds/last.json?api_key=\" + apiKey;\n\n  var response = UrlFetchApp.fetch(url);\n  var data = JSON.parse(response.getContentText());\n\n  var sheet = SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSheet();\n  sheet.appendRow([data.created_at, data.field1, data.field2]); // Adjust fields as needed\n}\n\n// Set up a trigger to run the script periodically (e.g., every minute)\nfunction createTimeDrivenTriggers() {\n  // Trigger every minute\n  ScriptApp.newTrigger(\u0027getThingSpeakData\u0027)\n      .timeBased()\n      .everyMinutes(1)\n      .create();\n}\n",
    "title":  "Speak things",
